      "statement": "Roast profile is filtered only via the generic boolean search filter against cb.roast_profile (no closeness scoring), and the frontend SearchFilters component builds an OR query that always appends 'Both' when Espresso or Filter is selected and appends 'Omni' when 'include omni' is checked.",
